  "body": "Whether you are looking to simplify your lifestyle or retire by the beach, this adorable and affordable two bedroom unit is an opportunity that is hard to pass up.\r\n\r\nOrewa College is practically across the road, and Orewa Beach is a short walk away. Few locations are this convenient. This unit is one of only three on the site, offering easy, low-maintenance living without the crowds of a big complex.\r\n\r\nIt's all on one level, with a simple, practical layout. The living and dining area flows from the front entry, and the kitchen features an island style return bench with plenty of drawer storage. Both bedrooms are generously sized. The bathroom and separate toilet suit sharing or guests. Outside, a sunny private deck with screening gives you a spot for morning coffee or an evening drink.\r\n\r\nYou will just love being close to the beach and Orewa's cafés, shops and restaurants. It's ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers and retirees wanting a lock-and-leave.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n• Orewa College just across the road\r\n• Walk to Orewa Beach and town\r\n• 2 double bedrooms\r\n• Single-level living\r\n• Kitchen with island return style bench\r\n• Bathroom plus separate toilet\r\n• Single garage with internal laundry\r\n• Private, screened deck\r\n\r\nAffordable properties in this location are becoming increasingly hard to find. Opportunities like this don't come up often. Call today to arrange a viewing or visit my open home.",
